# OREN Pterodactyl Installer

🚀 **OREN Pterodactyl Installer** is a powerful, interactive Linux management suite designed to simplify the installation, configuration, maintenance, and management of Pterodactyl Panel, Wings, Docker, databases, web servers, runtimes, and more.

Built with a clean category-based interface, OREN keeps advanced server tools organized and easy to access.

### ✨ Features

* 🖥️ Pterodactyl Panel management
* 🪽 Wings & Node management
* 🐍 Python runtime management
* 🟢 Node.js runtime management
* ☕ Java runtime management
* 🐘 PHP management
* 🗄️ MariaDB & Redis tools
* 🐳 Docker management
* 🌐 Nginx & SSL tools
* 🔐 Firewall & security tools
* 💾 Backup & restore utilities
* 🩺 Server diagnostics
* 🔧 Maintenance tools
* ⚡ Server optimization tools
* 🛠️ Advanced Linux utilities
* 📊 Automatic system information detection
* 📝 Detailed installer logging
* 🎛️ Clean nested menu system

### 🎯 Goal

OREN aims to provide a single, reliable command-line toolkit for managing Pterodactyl infrastructure without needing to remember dozens of Linux commands.

